        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST \nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic 2 Bed / 2 Bath Apartment, located in the highly sought-after and ideally located Laurel House development in Carrickmines, Dublin 18.\nThis modern and spacious property comprises of a bright open-plan living space, a fully fitted kitchen, a large private balcony, two double bedrooms, one ensuite, and a main bathroom with both bath & shower. The entire property is fully furnished and tastefully decorated throughout with elevator access and designated underground parking.\nIn terms of location, Carrickmines is the perfect midpoint from South Dublin to North Wicklow, with many local attractions within arm's reach. To name a few, Laurel House is a 15 minute drive to the seaside town of Bray, a 10 minute drive to Killiney Beach, 5 minute drive from Leopardstown Racecourse, and has every amenity nearby including Carrickmines Park Shopping Centre which is within walking distance. As for transport, there are various Dublin Bus Links on its doorstep and Ballyogan LUAS Stop just 10 minutes' walk away for direct access to Dublin City Centre and the surrounding areas.\nFeatures:\n1.Fully Furnished\n2.2 Double Bedrooms\n3.2 Bathrooms (1 Ensuite)\n4.Private Balcony\n5.Elevator Access\n6.Designated Parking\n7.Prime Location\n8.Dublin Bus Links on its' Doorstep\n9.Walking Distance to Green Line LUAS\n10.Various Local Attractions Nearby\n11.Available Now!\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE\n"
      },
